": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4c54fbc0cf4396ad0aa5e66353c80349cdab24d9", "message": "Create a custom hook to fetch data from API\n\nIn the custom hook, I have used axios library to fetch data via proxy.", "created_at": "2022-10-28T14:29:20Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae43a5b0884268cff6dd72ed370b65bde708e77a", "message": "Create component to display single program with fetched data.\n\nComponent aggregates create components with details, thumbnails, and ratings.", "created_at": "2022-10-28T14:27:00Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "44def31553fc589d8ae36f77a7c76df5ffbb8c2d", "message": "Create the component to display reviews from IMDb\n\nThe component renders svg star with color depending on if ratings existance", "created_at": "2022-10-28T14:25:34Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39984f52361f8b39ea0845a4db71c30cdd6964c7", "message": "Create the component to display the movie thumbnail.\n\nThe component includes conditional rendering depending on the viewport size. In the large viewport size, the landscape is rendered, in a small image.", "created_at": "2022-10-28T14:19:22Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a290fe7de179fed20498463b0444084139745f48", "message": "Create new component to display program details\n\nThis component includes program title, streaming, and genre lists which are conditionally displayed depending on viewport size.\nThis one also comes with basic styling.", "created_at": "2022-10-28T14:14:58Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5b9f61cf7c3a98b29585050d0611fabd064f087b", "message": "Create the Checkbox component\n\nCheckbox component including input with type checkbox and label, props come from the main Program Listcomponent.\nAdditionally, create CSS file for this component with basic styling.", "created_at": "2022-10-28T14:11:04Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f810b0686685be67ecf96abeffbf3cee2237a1cb", "message": "Create the component with sort buttons\n\nComponent including to svgs, sort Handler method which is called on onClick event is declared in the main ProgramList component", "created_at": "2022-10-28T14:09:29Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6dce8d05c510090c41f2061a956aa73f375494be", "message": "Create the Checkbox component\n\nAdd basic styling for created component. The handleChange method comes from ProgramsList component.", "created_at": "2022-10-27T21:59:33Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8bb18d3d4dc99754c89394f22bbc73be35806299", "message": "Install the react-bootstrap package", "created_at": "2022-10-27T21:56:23Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7b87b98416ef6d23b5f4a2976e34c2872987c7cb", "message": "Create first component - ProgramList.jsx\n\nThe main component with some logic", "created_at": "2022-10-27T21:53:42Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "878463b68a90fd5697af43951436b5a0ede88345", "message": "Cleanup unnecessary code", "created_at": "2022-10-26T15:35:56Z", "repo": "schibstedRecruitmentTask", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b1d5e4e111f064545bb8642fd9f2f3c0f4347e96", "message": "Create api proxy script\n\nLazybus API is not sending CORS headers so that to work locally wit